{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女神金智媛主演，改編自日劇的韓國醫療劇《Doctor X：白色黑手黨時代》正熱播，日前播映第6集，因劇情涉及政治題材而惹起爭議，但無損金智媛的心情。</p><p>她昨日以一襲白色露肩裝亮相代言國際珠寶品牌在首爾江南區清潭洞舉行的宣傳活動，展現優雅氣質</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:41:13.512753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:23:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:08.580724+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:08.580724+00:00","content_hash":"4f379f37c70e8cc77e9cd8f0a4dc5731fbc25de1c625d3d4fe74bfba52e87d39","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}